  "headline": "FDA's records show hydroxocobalamin shortage listed since 2024-11-04 with no signal at our plants",
  "headline_cites": ["E6", "E4", "E5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the hydroxocobalamin shortage on 2024-11-04 and it has remained on the list for 24 months as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E6", "D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The shortage lists BTG International Inc. and Teva Pharmaceuticals USA, Inc. as current with estimated recovery for Teva in mid-November 2026.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our supply at both Corvale East and Corvale General carries NDC 00591288830 labeled by Actavis Pharma, Inc. with the product label naming Hikma Farmaceutica (Portugal) S.A. as the manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "No FDA signal has been posted for the Hikma Farmaceutica (Portugal) S.A. plant associated with our supply.",
      "cites": ["E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 5 days on hand while Corvale General has 19 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best option by rule is to transfer 19 units from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would bring Corvale East to 10 days on hand while Corvale General maintains two weeks of supply.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    }
  ]
}
